ter","html":"IX"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.IX four-valued adequate-structure framework, §§2.2,3.1–3.3, print643–653/PDF655–665; local example"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"local argument checked; not machine checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-22"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"2026-10-22-expansion"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>H={A}，其中 A 是一个 ground 原子；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal T_P,I_n\">\\(\\mathcal T_P,I_n\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"dd6da9fb2b3060fc\" href=\"?note=dd6da9fb2b3060fc\" title=\"72-df-finite-ground-program-operator\">72-df-finite-ground-program-operator</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5fda4571139fdbc0\" href=\"?note=5fda4571139fdbc0\" title=\"72-thm-finite-ground-information-fixed-point\">72-thm-finite-ground-information-fixed-point</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"P:=\\{\\langle A,\\langle-A\\rangle\\rangle\\},\\qquad\n\\forall I\\in\\mathsf{Four}^{\\{A\\}}\\ (\\mathcal T_P(I)(A)=\\sim I(A)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[P:=\\{\\langle A,\\langle-A\\rangle\\rangle\\},\\qquad\n\\forall I\\in\\mathsf{Four}^{\\{A\\}}\\ (\\mathcal T_P(I)(A)=\\sim I(A)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall n\\in\\omega\\ (I_n(A)=\\mathsf u),\\qquad\n\\{I\\in\\mathsf{Four}^{\\{A\\}}:\\mathcal T_P(I)=I\\}\n=\\{\\{\\langle A,\\mathsf u\\rangle\\},\\{\\langle A,\\mathsf c\\rangle\\}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall n\\in\\omega\\ (I_n(A)=\\mathsf u),\\qquad\n\\{I\\in\\mathsf{Four}^{\\{A\\}}:\\mathcal T_P(I)=I\\}\n=\\{\\{\\langle A,\\mathsf u\\rangle\\},\\{\\langle A,\\mathsf c\\rangle\\}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>交换两坐标的不动值只有 (0,0) 和 (1,1)。从信息底 (0,0) 迭代不增，故最小模型为未知；矛盾值也是不动点但不最小。经典二值没有这个否定自环的模型，不能据此把未知补为假。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-finite-ground-program-operator","status":"resolved","id":"dd6da9fb2b3060fc","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-finite-ground-program-operator]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-thm-finite-ground-information-fixed-point","status":"resolved","id":"5fda4571139fdbc0","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-thm-finite-ground-information-fixed-point]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-finite-ground-program-operator","status":"resolved","id":"dd6da9fb2b3060fc","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"H={A}，其中 A 是一个 ground 原子；$\\mathcal T_P,I_n$ 取 [[72-df-finite-ground-program-operator]]、[[72-thm-finite-ground-information-fixed-point]]。","embed":false},{"target":"72-thm-finite-ground-information-fixed-point","status":"resolved","id":"5fda4571139fdbc0","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"H={A}，其中 A 是一个 ground 原子；$\\mathcal T_P,I_n$ 取 [[72-df-finite-ground-program-operator]]、[[72-thm-finite-ground-information-fixed-point]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal T_P,I_n","display":false},{"tex":"P:=\\{\\langle A,\\langle-A\\rangle\\rangle\\},\\qquad\n\\forall I\\in\\mathsf{Four}^{\\{A\\}}\\ (\\mathcal T_P(I)(A)=\\sim I(A)).","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall n\\in\\omega\\ (I_n(A)=\\mathsf u),\\qquad\n\\{I\\in\\mathsf{Four}^{\\{A\\}}:\\mathcal T_P(I)=I\\}\n=\\{\\{\\langle A,\\mathsf u\\rangle\\},\\{\\langle A,\\mathsf c\\rangle\\}\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":1694,"backlinks":[{"id":"e6c99e2646691c7d","anchor":"ref-179","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"IX章新增13项：[[72-df-finite-ground-program-operator]] · [[72-df-logic-program-substitution]] · [[72-df-sld-refutation-answer]] · [[72-df-sld-resolution-step]] · [[72-df-sldnf-abstract-success-failure]] · [[72-df-sldnf-safe-pair]] · [[72-df-unifier-most-general-unifier]] · [[72-ex-ground-goal-may-be-unsafe]] · [[72-ex-ground-negative-loop-information]] · [[72-lem-program-substitution-composition]] · [[72-thm-finite-ground-information-fixed-point]] · [[72-thm-first-order-unification]] · [[72-thm-sld-answer-soundness]]"},{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-553","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"IX章新增13项：[[72-df-finite-ground-program-operator]] · [[72-df-logic-program-substitution]] · [[72-df-sld-refutation-answer]] · [[72-df-sld-resolution-step]] · [[72-df-sldnf-abstract-success-failure]] · [[72-df-sldnf-safe-pair]] · [[72-df-unifier-most-general-unifier]] · [[72-ex-ground-goal-may-be-unsafe]] · [[72-ex-ground-negative-loop-information]] · [[72-lem-program-substitution-composition]] · [[72-thm-finite-ground-information-fixed-point]] · [[72-thm-first-order-unification]] · [[72-thm-sld-answer-soundness]]"},{"id":"70ff58eeae2491db","anchor":"ref-548","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"IX章新增13项：[[72-df-finite-ground-program-operator]] · [[72-df-logic-program-substitution]] · [[72-df-sld-refutation-answer]] · [[72-df-sld-resolution-step]] · [[72-df-sldnf-abstract-success-failure]] · [[72-df-sldnf-safe-pair]] · [[72-df-unifier-most-general-unifier]] · [[72-ex-ground-goal-may-be-unsafe]] · [[72-ex-ground-negative-loop-information]] · [[72-lem-program-substitution-composition]] · [[72-thm-finite